<title>USA: Calloway Cty PPC, Ky., won by Ross Sinclaire.</title>
<headline>Calloway Cty PPC, Ky., won by Ross Sinclaire.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ross Sinclaire &amp; Associates, Inc. said it won $4.670 million of Calloway Cty Public Properties Corp., Ky., special voted ad valorem tax first mortgage revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.20 percent.</p>
</text>
